<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister of Finance may, after consultation with the Minister, dispose of any securities issued or of any rights to securities initially allotted to the Corporation in pursuance of this section."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/eng@> .
