<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/eng@/~part_I__cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Lembaga Padi Dan Beras Negara (Successor Company) Act 1994 and shall come into force on such date as the Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, appoint."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/eng@> .
